abstract: >-
  Audit-format templates for recording assessments of the people assigned
  to oversee an AI system: a competence matrix, time-on-task and
  seeded-error records, and a control-testing workpaper.
keywords:
  - AI governance
  - human oversight
  - automation bias
  - EU AI Act
  - conformity assessment
  - internal audit
